WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.987
What does this mean?

00:00:01.937 --> 00:00:09.962
Every single MP who voted yes on both MAID bills also voted to invoke the Emergencies Act against peaceful protesters.

00:00:09.962 --> 00:00:12.762
This is not a sample or a trend.

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:17.612
It is a 100 percent correlation across 46 legislators.

00:00:17.612 --> 00:00:26.050
The same MPs who authorized the state to terminate citizens also authorized freezing bank accounts and suspending civil liberties.
